      "is": "IS 10238:2001",
      "clause": "9",
      "title": "Designation – The step",
      "text": "9. Designation - The step bolts shall be designated by the size, length and the number of this Indian Standard. The letter NN shall be added to the designation to indicate supply with two nuts. Example - A step bolt of size M16 and length 175mm with two hexagon nuts shall be designated as - Step bolts M16×175 NN IS 10238 +  Technical supply conditions for threaded steel  fasteners",
